@startuml
title MyNetMate - Web client / server interface contracts\nThree INDEPENDENT revision pairs | URL-contract trace, not a merged system or E2E test
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam padding 10
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7FBFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #315A78
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
component "Network pair: website main 28ac37b / backend main 166e2ee" as NetworkPair {
 component "web : NetworkWebClient" as NW {
  portout " " as R_W01
  portout " " as R_W02
 }
 component "api : NetworkHttpBoundary" as NA {
  portin " " as P_W01
  portin " " as P_W02
 }
 R_W01 -(0- P_W01 : W01: IDeviceInventoryHttp
 R_W02 -(0- P_W02 : W02: IDiscoveryEventStream
}
component "Configuration pair: website config-ui ad95634 / backend main 166e2ee" as ConfigPair {
 component "web : ConfigurationWebClient" as CW {
  portout " " as R_W03
  portout " " as R_W04
  portout " " as R_W05
  portout " " as R_W06
  portout " " as R_W07
 }
 component "api : ConfigurationHttpBoundary" as CA {
  portin " " as P_W03
  portin " " as P_W04
  portin " " as P_W05
  portin " " as P_W06
  portin " " as P_W07
 }
 R_W03 -(0- P_W03 : W03: IConfigPreviewHttp
 R_W04 -(0- P_W04 : W04: IConfigVersionHttp
 R_W05 -(0- P_W05 : W05: IConfigDriftHttp
 R_W06 -(0- P_W06 : W06: IInteractiveSshWebSocket
 R_W07 -(0- P_W07 : W07: IDeviceDetailHttp
}
component "Identity pair: website auth-audit-ui 3e4d85c / backend audit-writer b862c60" as AuthPair {
 component "web : IdentityAuditWebClient" as AW {
  portout " " as R_W08
  portout " " as R_W09
  portout " " as R_W10
 }
 component "api : IdentityAuditHttpBoundary" as AA {
  portin " " as P_W08
  portin " " as P_W09
  portin " " as P_W10
 }
 R_W08 -(0- P_W08 : W08: ISessionHttp
 R_W09 -(0- P_W09 : W09: IUserAdminHttp
 R_W10 -(0- P_W10 : W10: IAuditReadHttp
}
legend bottom left
 Square = UML Port (name suppressed). Socket = required; ball = provided.
 Each assembly joins two simple ports for ONE named interface.
 role : ComponentType denotes a part; types are logical software-module abstractions.
 Contract IDs map to operations and immutable source evidence in README / CONTRACTS.md.
 Each frame is a separate client/server contract mapping under the configured API base URL.
 All contracts have source call sites; matching paths alone do not prove runtime interoperability.
 The Configuration HTTP boundary includes config routers and the devices detail / SSH endpoints.
 No binding joins the three frames. No CIS UI or Dashboard data service is invented.
endlegend
@enduml

